OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'infuriating' 999 calls made
OL,4,Ato police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA female has dialled 999 and is telling
OL,7,Fthe bewildered Humberside Police
OL,8,Foperator she wishes to report being
OL,9,Fassaulted by an alien.
OL,11,FIt is not immediately clear whether the
OL,12,Fperson is suffering from a mental
OL,13,Fhealth episode, but it will be logged
OL,14,Fby the force as a hoax call.
OL,16,FContact officer Ben Parry, who took the
OL,17,Fcall, reveals more.
OL,19,F"She [the caller] said that she had
OL,20,Fbeen assaulted by an alien outside her
OL,21,Fhome address, and that they worked for
OL,22,Fthe government," he says.
